  "button:pi pi-pencil "Draw a freeform region (<kbd>f</kbd>)"",
  "button:wand.svg "Wand: click and drag to grow a region by similar pixel values (<kbd>w</kbd>). <br>Hold <kbd>Shift</kbd> while clicking or dragging on a region to erase pixels from it."",
